    <name>SplitKeyboard</name>
    <summary>A split-layout on-screen keyboard for X11 (wide displays / Steam Deck)</summary>

    <description>
        <p>
            SplitKeyboard is an X11 on-screen keyboard, a fork of CoreKeyboard, with the keys packed into the left and right quarters of the screen and a see-through, click-through middle. It's built for two-thumb typing on wide displays such as the Steam Deck, and supports multitouch and hybrid (armed / momentary) modifiers.
        </p>
        <p>
            It requires an X11 session (for example the Steam Deck's desktop mode). On Wayland it runs through XWayland but cannot inject keystrokes into native Wayland windows, so it is not intended for Wayland desktops.
        </p>
    </description>

